error[unreachable]: condition repeats earlier condition of same `if` chain
 --> positive.jl:7:12
  |
3 |     if x > 0
  |        ----- same condition
...
7 |     elseif x > 0
  |            ^^^^^ branch never runs
  |
  = why: earlier branch takes every case where condition holds; condition has no side effects to change that
  = fix: change condition to intended one, or delete branch   [manual]
  = docs: corset explain unreachable
  = note: deny from correctness group, library preset
  = note: opt out with `# corset: allow unreachable -- <reason>`

